            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Every pet forgets its time with you: trust, habits, the things it found and the plant all start over. This can't be undone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所有宠物都会忘记和你相处的时光：信任、习惯、它找到的小东西和植物都会重新开始，无法恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
